== Change char-values: CharAt outside the String stops the program (kind 15).
Use Std.Strings

Main :
    Word := "água"
    Place := Length(Word)
    PutLn(CharAt(Word, Place))
    Place += 1
    PutLn(CharAt(Word, Place))
;
